From sdavis2 at mail.nih.gov  Mon Apr  2 20:24:21 2007
From: sdavis2 at mail.nih.gov (Sean Davis)
Date: Mon, 02 Apr 2007 14:24:21 -0400
Subject: [BioC] probe expression profile to gene expression profile
In-Reply-To: <cdf817830704021008g45957c07nf9375837c8df9822@mail.gmail.com>
References: <cdf817830704021008g45957c07nf9375837c8df9822@mail.gmail.com>
