Yi Xing wrote:
> Hi,
> 
> I have been trying to use gcrma to get expression indexes from mouse 
> 430_2 affymetrix arrays. However, I cannot get the appropriate CDF file 
> if I run 'just.gcrma'. Below is the error message. It seems that the 
